[Drumming, Singing and Dancing](/early-learning-and-kindergarten-incursions/) last week for Harmony Week at [Balmoral House](https://www.balmoralhousepreschool.com.au/) in Brisbane was fun and fantastic! This pre school was a beautiful little centre in the one of the beautiful leafy streets of Balmoral Brisbane.

The children here, were so excited about the dunduns it was hard to keep the sticks in my own hands! We laughed, sung and moved our bodies with our shakers for three sessions to celebrate Harmony Week. It was a joyful final workshop to end the week of Harmony Week for us at Rhythm Culture.

Thanks for having Balmoral Pre-school!!
